      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Its economy thrives on outdoor recreation, marinas, and small businesses that cater to visitors, with tourism peaking from spring through fall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
